{#
    Alert icon — the leading visual of an alert.

    Slot-only: the consumer brings their own icon (Tabler Icons font, ux-icons,
    inline SVG, FontAwesome — anything that renders inside the wrapper).

    Usage:
      <twig:Tabler:Alert:Icon>
          <i class="ti ti-check"></i>
      </twig:Tabler:Alert:Icon>
#}
<div {{ attributes.defaults({class: 'alert-icon'}) }}>{%- block content %}{% endblock -%}</div>
